                For years, clients traveled from Chattanooga, Cleveland, Knoxville, and beyond to our studio on US-411 under our original name, The Old Crow Tattoo Parlor. Today, as Spectrum Tattoo, our all-women team of artists and piercers brings the same fierce craft—with occasional horror photography, paranormal investigations, and laughs all day long.
            </p>
            <p>
                No intimidating gatekeeping. Just spotless stations, genuine conversation, thorough aftercare guidance, and artists who care as much about how your piece heals as how it looks on day one.
